<title>SOUTH AFRICA: East Dagga Dec qtr pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>East Dagga Dec qtr pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Pre-tax, -debenture interest income 16.02 vs 13.03</p>
<p>Full name: East Daggafontein Mines Ltd</p>
<p>Operating results:</p>
<p>Daggafontein plant</p>
<p>    Tonnes treated		   4,257,000 vs 4,175,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		     1,029 vs 913</p>
<p>Withok Dam Material - Ergo plant</p>
<p>    Tonnes treated		   2,063,000 vs 1,811,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 367 vs 325</p>
<p>Project Pluto - Ergo Plant</p>
<p>    Tonnes treated			    -  vs 1,490,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			  -  vs 397</p>
<p>6L13 PGM Project</p>
<p>    Tonnes treated		   5,883,000 vs 5,399,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		     6,214 vs 12,989</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that it continued to evaluate a number of projects that might be suitable for acquisition by East Daggafontein.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
